  {
   "__type__": "StringTableEntry",
   "__typeHash__": 3844612145,
   "szLabel": "Description",
   "szText": "Westmarch was in ruins. Its riches, ripe for the taking. Powat the Louse was wrist-deep in a nobleman's pockets when a cold shadow fell over him. He turned in a flash, bootknife drawn, but the shadow seized his body. \"Thief,\" it hissed as Powat's eyes turned solid black, \"You belong to Death.\"",
